{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"vim","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Vim script","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Vim script (.vim .vimrc).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"vim","name":"Vim script","extensions":[".vim",".vimrc"],"grammar":"grammars/vim.json","filenames":[".vimrc","_vimrc"],"lineComment":"\""}],"snippets":[{"language":"Vim script","path":"snippets/vim.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/vim.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\".*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[abglstvw]:[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"<[A-Za-z\\\\-]+>\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:endfunction|highlight|setlocal|endwhile|function|nnoremap|inoremap|vnoremap|execute|command|autocmd|augroup|noremap|elseif|endfor|return|syntax|source|finish|endtry|unlet|endif|while|catch|else|call|nmap|imap|vmap|let|set|for|map|try|if)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:v:false|v:true|false|true)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/vim.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fun\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"function! ${1:Name}(${2:args})\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"endfunction\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function\"\n  },\n  \"Autocmd group\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"aug\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"augroup ${1:name}\",\n      \"\\tautocmd!\",\n      \"\\tautocmd ${2:BufWritePre} ${3:*} $0\",\n      \"augroup END\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An autocmd group\"\n  },\n  \"Normal map\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"nnoremap <silent> ${1:<leader>x} ${2::command<CR>}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A normal mode map\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Vim script\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Vim script.\n\n## Files\n\n`.vim`, `.vimrc`, `.vimrc`, `_vimrc`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `\"`.\n- 3 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `fun` | A function |\n| `aug` | An autocmd group |\n| `nn` | A normal mode map |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}